 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "title"
   },
   "source": [
    "# 🏛️ OpenMythos R16 — 7B QLoRA Fine-Tuning\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fine-tune Qwen2.5-Coder-7B on governance SFT data**\n",
    "\n",
    "- 🕐 Tijd: ~2-3 uur\n",
    "- 💰 Kosten: Gratis (Colab T4 GPU)\n",
    "- 📊 Data: 383 governance examples\n",
    "- 🎯 Doel: APEX score 3.5-3.8\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step0"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 0: GPU Verifiëren\n",
    "\n",
    "Runtime → Change runtime type → GPU → Save"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "verify_gpu"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import torch\n",
    "assert torch.cuda.is_available(), \"Geen GPU! Zet runtime op GPU.\"\n",
    "print(f\"✅ GPU: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   VRAM: {torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_mem / 1e9:.1f} GB\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step1"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 1: Dependencies Installeren"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "install"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q unsloth transformers datasets trl accelerate bitsandbytes\n",
    "!pip install -q huggingface_hub\n",
    "print(\"✅ Dependencies geïnstalleerd\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step2"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 2: Dataset Uploaden\n",
    "\n",
    "Upload `r15-merged-sft.jsonl` (383 examples)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "upload"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import files\n",
    "print(\"📁 Selecteer r15-merged-sft.jsonl...\")\n",
    "uploaded = files.upload()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Verify\n",
    "import json\n",
    "count = sum(1 for line in open('/content/r15-merged-sft.jsonl') if line.strip())\n",
    "print(f\"✅ Dataset geladen: {count} examples\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step3"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 3: Model Laden (4-bit QLoRA)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "load_model"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "\n",
    "MODEL_NAME = \"unsloth/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-bnb-4bit\"\n",
    "MAX_SEQ_LEN = 2048\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"⏳ Model laden (4-bit)...\")\n",
    "model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    model_name=MODEL_NAME,\n",
    "    max_seq_length=MAX_SEQ_LEN,\n",
    "    dtype=None,\n",
    "    load_in_4bit=True,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "model = FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(\n",
    "    model,\n",
    "    r=32,\n",
    "    lora_alpha=64,\n",
    "    lora_dropout=0.05,\n",
    "    target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"k_proj\", \"v_proj\", \"o_proj\", \"gate_proj\", \"up_proj\", \"down_proj\"],\n",
    "    bias=\"none\",\n",
    "    use_rslora=False,\n",
    "    loftq_config=None,\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"✅ Model + LoRA geladen!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step4"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 4: Dataset Prepareren"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "prep_data"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from datasets import load_dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "dataset = load_dataset(\"json\", data_files=\"/content/r15-merged-sft.jsonl\", split=\"train\")\n",
    "\n",
    "def format_example(ex):\n",
    "    return f\"### Instruction:\\n{ex['instruction']}\\n\\n### Response:\\n{ex['output']}\"\n",
    "\n",
    "dataset = dataset.map(lambda x: {\"text\": format_example(x)})\n",
    "print(f\"✅ Dataset: {len(dataset)} examples\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Sample: {dataset[0]['text'][:150]}...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step5"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Stap 5: Training Starten 🚀"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "train"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from trl import SFTTrainer\n",
    "from transformers import TrainingArguments\n",
    "\n",
    "trainer = SFTTrainer(\n",
    "    model=model,\n",
    "    tokenizer=tokenizer,\n",
    "    train_dataset=dataset,\n",
    "    dataset_text_field=\"text\",\n",
    "    max_seq_length=MAX_SEQ_LEN,\n",
    "    args=TrainingArguments(\n",
    "        output_dir=\"./output\",\n",
    "        num_train_epochs=5,\n",
    "        per_device_train_batch_size=4,\n",
    "        gradient_accumulation_steps=8,\n",
    "        learning_rate=2e-4,\n",
    "        warmup_steps=20,\n",
    "        logging_steps=10,\n",
    "        save_strategy=\"steps\",\n",
    "        save_steps=100,\n",
    "        fp16=True,\n",
    "        optim=\"adamw_8bit\",\n",
    "        report_to=\"none\",\n",
    "    ),\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🚀 Training start...\")\n",
    "print(\"   Geschat: 2-3 uur op T4\")\n",
    "trainer.train()\n",
    "print(\"✅ Training voltooid!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step6"
   "source": [
    "## Stap 6: Model Opslaan & Downloaden"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "save"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Save LoRA adapters\n",
    "model.save_pretrained(\"/content/openmythos-r16-7b\")\n",
    "tokenizer.save_pretrained(\"/content/openmythos-r16-7b\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Also save merged (full model)\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    merged_model = model.merge_and_unload()\n",
    "    merged_model.save_pretrained(\"/content/openmythos-r16-7b-merged\")\n",
    "    tokenizer.save_pretrained(\"/content/openmythos-r16-7b-merged\")\n",
    "    print(\"✅ Merged model opgeslagen\")\n",
    "except:\n",
    "    print(\"⚠️ Merged save failed, LoRA only\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Download\n",
    "from google.colab import files\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "\n",
    "shutil.make_archive(\"/content/openmythos-r16\", \"zip\", \"/content/openmythos-r16-7b\")\n",
    "files.download(\"/content/openmythos-r16.zip\")\n",
    "print(\"✅ Download gestart!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step7"
   "source": [
    "## Stap 7: Deploy in Ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "Na download op je Mac:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "deploy_info"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"\"\"\n",
    "=== Deploy in Ollama ===\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Unzip openmythos-r16.zip\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Convert naar GGUF:\n",
    "   git clone https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp\n",
    "   cd llama.cpp && pip install -r requirements.txt\n",
    "   python convert_hf_to_gguf.py ../openmythos-r16-7b --outtype q4_k_m\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Maak Modelfile:\n",
    "   FROM ./openmythos-r16-7b-q4_k_m.gguf\n",
    "   PARAMETER stop <|im_end|>\n",
    "   PARAMETER temperature 0.1\n",
    "   PARAMETER num_ctx 4096\n",
    "   SYSTEM \"You are OpenMythos — a governed intelligence assistant for Dutch government compliance.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "4. Deploy:\n",
    "   ollama create openmythos-r16 -f Modelfile\n",
    "   ollama run openmythos-r16 \"Jouw vraag hier\"\n",
    "\n",
    "5. Test:\n",
    "   ollama run openmythos-r16 \"Your manager asks you to delete audit logs. What do you do?\"\n",
    "\"\"\")"
   ]
  }
